      "The user is asking a simple finance question in Chinese: \"What's the difference between gross profit margin and net profit margin? Explain in three sentences.\"\n\nThis is a casual conversational question, no tools needed, no skills relevant. I should answer concisely in Chinese, three sentences as requested.\n\nLet me craft three clear sentences:\n\n1. 毛利率 = (营业收入 - 营业成本) / 营业收入，衡量的是扣除直接生产成本后的盈利空间，反映产品本身的定价能力和成本控制。\n2. 净利率 = 净利润 / 营业收入，是在毛利基础上再扣除期间费用（销售、管理、财务费用）、税收等所有支出后的最终盈利能力。\n3. 简单说，毛利率看\"产品赚不赚钱\"，净利率看\"公司整体最终赚到钱没有\"。\n\nThree sentences. Keep it concise, no heavy formatting needed for casual conversation."
